Package: linreg
Type: Package
Title: Linear Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Payson", "Johanson",
      email = "pwjohan@umich.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Re-implements ordinary least squares linear regression from
    scratch, computing coefficient estimates, standard errors, t-tests,
    R-squared, and the overall F-test without calling lm(). Includes
    print, summary, and predict methods that mirror those for lm objects.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/pwjohan/linreg
BugReports: https://github.com/pwjohan/linreg/issues
